---
.title = "Create a TAR archive"
.date = "2024-01-01"
.author = "ZigCC"
.layout = "section.shtml"
---

The standard library includes a TAR writer. TAR groups files but does not
compress them; pair it with gzip or zstd when compression is required. Zig
currently exposes ZIP parsing/extraction rather than a portable ZIP writer, so
this recipe uses TAR and calls out that constraint explicitly.

